    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[26]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Look who decided to talk to me.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[27]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: I can't deal with this by myself anymore
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[27]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: I'm so sorry this is happening, Luna. We will help address this situation immediately. You are not alone.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[28]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Why would you do this to me?! I thought we were friends.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[28]._dialogues.Array.data[1]._content
      value: You seriously believed that someone wanted to be your friend? Pathetic.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[29]._dialogues.Array.data[0]._content
      value: Stay away, you freak!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
