      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[22]._dialogues.Array.data[26]._content
      value: Awwww, she's gonna cry again.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[23]._dialogues.Array.data[10]._content
      value: What messages? ;)
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[23]._dialogues.Array.data[11]._content
      value: Those are MY messages...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[23]._dialogues.Array.data[12]._content
      value: Awwww, don't tell me you haven't figured it out yet?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[23]._dialogues.Array.data[13]._content
      value: No...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[23]._dialogues.Array.data[14]._content
      value: That was YOU?!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[23]._dialogues.Array.data[15]._content
      value: SURPRISEEEE
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[23]._dialogues.Array.data[16]._content
      value: HAHAHAHA you should've seen your face
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[23]._dialogues.Array.data[17]._content
      value: But... why?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[23]._dialogues.Array.data[18]._content
      value: Because you're so easy to mess with HAHAHA
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[23]._dialogues.Array.data[19]._content
      value: I thought...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[23]._dialogues.Array.data[20]._content
      value: You thought WHAT? That someone actually wanted to be friends with you?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[23]._dialogues.Array.data[21]._content
      value: And you even sent me a picture of yourself HAHAHA
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[23]._dialogues.Array.data[22]._content
      value: You actually trusted a random person on the internet?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[23]._dialogues.Array.data[23]._content
      value: I thought we were friends...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[23]._dialogues.Array.data[24]._content
      value: Well, you thought wrong.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[23]._dialogues.Array.data[25]._content
      value: You said you cared about me...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[23]._dialogues.Array.data[26]._content
      value: HAHAHAHA AND YOU BELIEVED ME?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[23]._dialogues.Array.data[27]._content
      value: I told you things I haven't told anyone...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[23]._dialogues.Array.data[28]._content
      value: Yeah, I know. You really don't have any friends, do you?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4398672150626424371, guid: 5988493fe5441904b9c668d6bff4eb52, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _inspectorNarrativeNodes.Array.data[23]._dialogues.Array.data[29]._content
      value: Awwww, she's gonna cry again.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
